<title>USA: ENCAD signs sales pact with Kodak.</title>
<headline>ENCAD signs sales pact with Kodak.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>ENCAD Inc on Wednesday said it has struck a deal with Eastman Kodak Co to sell its NovaJet PROe series printers to Kodak for resale around the world as customized, high performance photo imaging systems.</p>
<p>Financial terms were undisclosed.</p>
<p>ENCAD's shares were up 3/4 to 33-3/8 by mid-afternoon.</p>
<p>The two company's hope to strengthen their positions in the photo market through the deal. The new system will be unveiled at a trade show in late April, and Kodak is expected to start shipments in July, ENCAD said in a statement.</p>
</text>
